The tree verification logic in dtree_mlx/dtree_runtime.py and
dtree_mlx/qwen3_tree.py is a port of the DDTree reference
implementation, adapted from PyTorch to MLX and restricted to Qwen3.

The DFlash verification logic in dtree_mlx/runtime.py is adapted
from dflash-mlx.

